post_install() {
	cat <<'NOTE'
mdn reads ~/.config/mdn/config.yml and will not start without a notes root:

    notes_root: /home/you/notes
    port: 7337

Then, as your own user, not as root:

    systemctl --user enable --now mdn

The daemon binds to localhost only; `mdn token` prints the bearer token the
browser extension presents. See https://github.com/davison/md-notes
NOTE
}
